# Normalise line endings in the object store. The tree is developed on
# Windows, where a global core.autocrlf is the only thing currently keeping
# CRLF out of committed files -- a per-machine setting, not a repo policy.
* text=auto

# PowerShell is the one script type here and Windows hosts want CRLF.
*.ps1 text eol=crlf

# Git's heuristic is right about these, but a mis-detected binary under
# `text=auto` is corrupted on checkout, so say it explicitly.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.keystore binary
*.jks binary
*.wav binary

# Resolved by `flutter pub get`; collapse it in review diffs.
pubspec.lock linguist-generated=true

# progress.md 的 session 紀錄與偏差只追加：平行的票各加一行，合併時兩邊都留（git 內建 union）。
docs/progress.md merge=union
